{"id":"php-seguridad-control-de-asistencia-y-filtrado-defensivo-multi-criterio-con-whitelists","title":"PHP - Seguridad - Control de Asistencia y Filtrado Defensivo Multi-Criterio con Whitelists","topic":"php","topicLabel":"PHP","tags":["aprendizaje","php","seguridad","whitelists","filtros","asistencia","backoffice"],"course":null,"headings":[{"depth":2,"text":"¿Qué es?","id":"que-es"},{"depth":2,"text":"1. Validación por Listas Blancas (Whitelists) en Filtros","id":"1-validacion-por-listas-blancas-whitelists-en-filtros"},{"depth":2,"text":"2. Patrón SQL Opcional Multi-Criterio","id":"2-patron-sql-opcional-multi-criterio"},{"depth":2,"text":"3. Control de Asistencia en Back-Office (admin/actualizarasistencia.php)","id":"3-control-de-asistencia-en-back-office-admin-actualizar-asis"},{"depth":2,"text":"Notas Relacionadas","id":"notas-relacionadas"}],"readingMins":2,"codeBlocks":4,"words":428,"html":"<h2 id=\"que-es\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">¿Qué es?</h2><p>El <strong>Control de Asistencia y Filtrado Defensivo Multi-Criterio con Whitelists</strong> comprende los mecanismos de seguridad e interfaz en el back-office (<code>admin/reservas.php</code> y <code>admin/actualizar_asistencia.php</code>) diseñados para permitir búsquedas dinámicas avanzadas y registro de asistencia presencial, validando obligatoriamente las entradas del cliente contra <strong>listas blancas (<em>Whitelists</em>)</strong> de valores permitidos antes de tocar la base de datos.</p>\n<hr>\n<h2 id=\"1-validacion-por-listas-blancas-whitelists-en-filtros\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">1. Validación por Listas Blancas (<em>Whitelists</em>) en Filtros</h2><p>Los formularios administrativos con desplegables <code>&lt;select&gt;</code> (para estados de reserva o asistencia) nunca deben inyectar directamente el valor de <code>$_GET</code> o <code>$_POST</code> en la consulta SQL.</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-comment\">// En admin/reservas.php</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estado</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">trim</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;estado&quot;</span>] ?? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">trim</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_GET</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;asistencia&quot;</span>] ?? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Listas Blancas (Whitelists) de valores válidos</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estados_permitidos</span> = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;confirmada&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;cancelada&quot;</span>];\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencias_permitidas</span> = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pendiente&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;asistio&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;no_asistio&quot;</span>];\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Sanitización por comprobación estricta</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">in_array</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estado</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estados_permitidos</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>)) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estado</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">in_array</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencias_permitidas</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>)) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>;\n}</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"2-patron-sql-opcional-multi-criterio\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">2. Patrón SQL Opcional Multi-Criterio</h2><p>Para permitir que el usuario aplique cualquier combinación de 5 filtros opcionales (fecha, actividad, estado, asistencia, texto de búsqueda) en una sola consulta SQL preparada:</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">sql</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-keyword\">SELECT</span> r.id_reserva, r.codigo_reserva, r.fecha_reserva, r.estado, r.asistencia, u.nombre, u.apellidos, u.email, s.fecha, s.hora_inicio, a.nombre <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AS</span> actividad, e.nombre <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AS</span> espacio\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">FROM</span> reservas r\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">INNER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">JOIN</span> usuarios u <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ON</span> r.id_usuario <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> u.id_usuario\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">INNER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">JOIN</span> sesiones s <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ON</span> r.id_sesion <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> s.id_sesion\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">INNER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">JOIN</span> actividades a <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ON</span> s.id_actividad <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> a.id_actividad\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">INNER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">JOIN</span> espacios e <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ON</span> s.id_espacio <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> e.id_espacio\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">WHERE</span> (? <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> s.fecha <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> ?)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AND</span> (? <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-number\">0</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> a.id_actividad <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> ?)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AND</span> (? <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> r.estado <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> ?)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AND</span> (? <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> r.asistencia <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> ?)\n  <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">AND</span> (? <span class=\"hljs-operator\">=</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&#x27;&#x27;</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> u.nombre <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LIKE</span> ? <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> u.apellidos <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LIKE</span> ? <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">OR</span> u.email <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">LIKE</span> ?)\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ORDER</span> <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">BY</span> s.fecha <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DESC</span>, s.hora_inicio <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">DESC</span>, u.apellidos <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ASC</span>, u.nombre <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">ASC</span>;</code></pre></div><p><strong>Vinculación de Parámetros (<code>bind_param</code>):</strong></p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-variable\">$patron</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;%&quot;</span> . <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$buscar</span> . <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;%&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">bind_param</span>(\n    <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;ssiissssssss&quot;</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$fecha</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$fecha</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_actividad</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_actividad</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estado</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$estado</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span>,\n    <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$buscar</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$patron</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$patron</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$patron</span>\n);</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"3-control-de-asistencia-en-back-office-admin-actualizar-asis\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">3. Control de Asistencia en Back-Office (<code>admin/actualizar_asistencia.php</code>)</h2><p>El registro de asistencia permite a los administradores marcar el estado final del participante (<code>pendiente</code>, <code>asistio</code>, <code>no_asistio</code>):</p>\n<div class=\"codeblock\"><div class=\"codeblock__bar\"><span class=\"codeblock__lang\">php</span><button class=\"codeblock__copy\" type=\"button\" data-copy>copiar</button></div><pre class=\"codeblock__pre\"><code class=\"hljs\"><span class=\"hljs-meta\">&lt;?php</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">require_once</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;seguridad_admin.php&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">require_once</span> <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;../conexion.php&quot;</span>;\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_SERVER</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;REQUEST_METHOD&quot;</span>] !== <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;POST&quot;</span>) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Location: reservas.php&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">exit</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_reserva</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">filter_input</span>(INPUT_POST, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id_reserva&quot;</span>, FILTER_VALIDATE_INT);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_sesion</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">filter_input</span>(INPUT_POST, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;id_sesion&quot;</span>, FILTER_VALIDATE_INT);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span> = <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">trim</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$_POST</span>[<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;asistencia&quot;</span>] ?? <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&quot;</span>);\n\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$valores_permitidos</span> = [<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;pendiente&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;asistio&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;no_asistio&quot;</span>];\n\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">if</span> (!<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_reserva</span> || !<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_sesion</span> || !<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">in_array</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$valores_permitidos</span>, <span class=\"hljs-literal\">true</span>)) {\n    <span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Location: reservas.php?error=datos&quot;</span>);\n    <span class=\"hljs-keyword\">exit</span>;\n}\n\n<span class=\"hljs-comment\">// Actualizar asistencia solo si la reserva está confirmada</span>\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql</span> = <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;UPDATE reservas SET asistencia = ? WHERE id_reserva = ? AND estado = &#x27;confirmada&#x27;&quot;</span>;\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span> = <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$conexion</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">prepare</span>(<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$sql</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">bind_param</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;si&quot;</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$asistencia</span>, <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_reserva</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">execute</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$stmt</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">close</span>();\n<span class=\"hljs-variable\">$conexion</span>-&gt;<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">close</span>();\n\n<span class=\"hljs-title function_ invoke__\">header</span>(<span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;Location: detalle_sesion.php?id=&quot;</span> . <span class=\"hljs-variable\">$id_sesion</span> . <span class=\"hljs-string\">&quot;&amp;mensaje=asistencia&quot;</span>);\n<span class=\"hljs-keyword\">exit</span>;</code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"notas-relacionadas\" class=\"note__h note__h--2\">Notas Relacionadas</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"nota.html?id=php-seguridad-control-de-acceso-y-gestion-de-roles-rbac\">PHP - Seguridad - Control de Acceso y Gestión de Roles (RBAC)</a> — Middleware <code>admin/seguridad_admin.php</code>.</li>\n<li><a href=\"nota.html?id=php-patrones-exportacion-de-datos-a-csv-con-codificacion-utf-8-bom-fputcsv\">PHP - Patrones - Exportación de Datos a CSV con Codificación UTF-8 BOM (fputcsv)</a> — Generación de reportes de asistencia.</li>\n<li><span class=\"wikilink-missing\">PHP - Fundamentos - Sanear Entrada de Usuario</span> — Sanitización con <code>filter_input()</code>.</li>\n</ul>\n"}